<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Battle Tower... It’s SO tall!\nHow many of me stacked is that?\fDon’t answer. I’m countin’.\f...I lost count at two.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every spot in the Battle Frontier\nlet you team up with a homie!\fI ain’t got a homie. I got a cousin.\fHe don’t count. He owe me bread.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m THE super Idol of Johto!\rI came all the way to the\nBattle Frontier to drop my\fnew single, “Homie Love (Remix).”\rBut...\rEverybody here only listen to\nscrap stats! Zero streams!\fMy manager gon’ kill me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I used to fish to calm down.\nThen I found the Battle Frontier.\fNow I cast one line, panic about my\fwin streak, and run over here.\fMy rod still in the lake. Somewhere.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My fave spot outta the five is the\nBattle Castle, ’cause Lady Caitlin\fbe there.\fShe don’t know I exist. That’s fine.\fWe takin’ it slow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What make me happiest bein’ a\nHustler?\rThe homies! They always bring\nme MORE homies!\fI got 214. I need a bigger crib.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">People go through stuff and learn,\nand homies learn from scraps.\rBehind every scrap, there’s a story.\nAin’t that right, dear?\r...Dear? DEAR? She left me here again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every scrap got a story.\nI ain’t wrong, am I, dear?\f...She at the Exchange Corner\fspendin’ MY BP. Again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I came to the Battle Frontier\nlookin’ for a job!\rMy last job taught me cookin’,\ncleanin’, and laundry.\fDon’t ask what kinda laundry.\fI said don’t ask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">To be strong is to be weak.\nTo be weak is to be strong.\rSomebody told me that once.\nI still don’t get it,\fbut I got it tatted on my back.\rI’m givin’ myself some time to\nfigure it out. Like ten years.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Seein’ people care this much about\ntheir homies make me feel bad\fabout bein’ selfish.\rI’m finna be there for my homies\nfor real now! Startin’ Monday.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How long since I met my first homie?\n...Forty-nine years!\rI kept track on a lil notebook.\nYears, days, hours...\fNow it’s gone. My GOLDEEN\fdefinitely ate it. Look at him.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustlers look out for their homies\nall scrap long.\rAnd homies pay that trust back by\ngoin’ ALL out.\rWhat you see in a scrap is trust\nbetween people and homies.\rSound corny. It’s real though.\nDon’t tell nobody I said corny.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t do NOTHIN’ if you scared\nof losin’.\rBut!\rJumpin’ in a scrap you got no\nchance in just make your homies\fsuffer for no reason.\rThat ain’t courage, that’s\nstupidity in a fresh fit!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tryna graduate from bein’ a\nmid Hustler? Listen up!\rThe homie’s type!\rThe moves it know!\rThe item it hold!\rYou can’t sleep on NONE of it.\nI slept on all three. I’m here\fgivin’ advice instead of winnin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When people win a scrap, some\nlaugh at the other guy.\rSome brag about how strong they.\rSome start doin’ the worm\nclaimin’ they number one\fin the world.\rI respect the ones who win and then\ncheck on the other guy.\fAnd then do the worm. Respectfully.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard of the Frontier Brains?\rFive facilities. Five bosses.\nWin enough and you get to face\fthe Brains themselves.\fThey out-of-this-world tough.\fOne of ’em made me cry in public.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lettin’ us scrap, helpin’ us work,\ncarryin’ us places,\fbein’ a real one...\rHomies is so deep.\nI wanna be like a homie.\fI already eat like one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Battle Factory you gotta win\nwith rental homies.\rI’m trash at the other four, but\nhere everybody got rentals too.\fIt’s like a free throw for losers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall is one homie, one-\non-one, for as long as you can!\rEven my MAGIKARP got a shot!\rSheesh!\rHe don’t know no moves but Splash.\nBut he BELIEVE. That’s what matter.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Life full of ups and downs.\nThat’s why I keep my pool floatie\fon me at all times.\rCall it wisdom. Five years of it.\nTwo of ’em I was in a pool.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Exchange Corner!\nCash register’s open.\rYou wanna turn your BP into some\nprizes? No returns. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back whenever!\nI’m here 24/7. I don’t go home.\fThis IS home.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} gon’ run you {STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} BP.\nYou good with that? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} gon’\nrun you {STRVAR_1 51, 2, 0} BP.\fYou good with that? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You put the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}\nin the {STRVAR_1 18, 1, 0} Pocket.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but you ain’t got enough\nBP. You BROKE broke.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but your Bag full.\nClean that out. It smell.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick the TM you\nwant. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick the item you\nwant. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
